<tr><td class="comment">人気のアメフクラガエルは３色展開。<br />
	２色目はイエロー。</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="img/fukuragaeru012.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/fukuragaeru012_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="img/fukuragaeru013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/fukuragaeru013_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
